FINAL ANSWER:
## Bus Factor Analysis (period: all)

**Project bus factor: 1.** Troy Goode is the single owner of the core code. Douglas Christopher Wilson is the second contributor, but has been inactive since 2021-09-07.

### Overview

The repo has 7 JS files and 1 runtime dependency file, `lib/index.js`. I analyzed all 7 files. No "Fiona Formatter" or bot commits count as ownership. The `62628c0` reformat commit and dependabot touched files without authoring logic.

| File | Top contributor (commits) | Others | Bus factor |
|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/index.js` | Troy Goode (29 of ~40, ~72%) | Wilson 4, Caravaca Puchades 4, Mansfield 3 | 1 (not >80%, but no one else is near) |
| `test/vary.js` | Troy Goode (1 of 1) | none | 1 |
| `test/example-app.js` | Troy Goode (10 of 13) | Wilson 2, formatter 1 | 1 |
| `test/issue-2.js` | Troy Goode (10 of 12) | Wilson 2 | 1 |
| `test/error-response.js` | Troy Goode (4 of 8) | Wilson 3, formatter 1 | 2 |
| `test/test.js` | Douglas Wilson (8 of 11) | 3 one-off contributors | 1, and Wilson is inactive |
| `test/support/env.js` | Douglas Wilson (1 of 1) | none | 1, and Wilson is inactive |

### Critical risk areas

| File | Sole owner | Owner active? | Dependents | Risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/index.js` | Troy Goode | Last commit 2026-04-10, about 6 months ago, so inactive by the 90-day rule | It is the package entry point, so every consumer | CRITICAL |
| `test/test.js` | Douglas Wilson | Inactive since 2021-09-07 | Main test suite | HIGH |

### By module

| Module | Primary owner | Ownership | Bus factor |
|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/` | Troy Goode | 33 of ~41 commits, ~80% | 1 |
| `test/` | Troy Goode (32), Wilson (23) | Troy ~55% | 2, but only Troy is recent |

### Heat map

```
repo/
├── lib/   [████████░░] 🔴 Bus Factor 1 (Troy Goode ~80%, inactive ~6mo)
└── test/  [██████░░░░] 🟡 Bus Factor 2 (Troy ~55%, Wilson ~40%, Wilson inactive since 2021)
```

### Recommendations

1. **Immediate:** A second person should review `lib/index.js`. Tell them to read the Troy Goode commit history, since he wrote most of it.
2. **Short-term:** `lib/index.js` is small and has only two dependencies, `object-assign` and `vary`. Document its behavior and add a few inline comments.
3. **Ongoing:** Distribute review and merge duty. Recent activity is formatter, bot and drive-by commits (Vansh Sharma, Ulises Gascón, Phillip Barta), so recruit one of them as a maintainer.

### Caveats

- The repo is small, so commit counts per file are low and percentages are rough.
- The activity check is relative to today (2026-10-22). The last repo commit is 2026-04-12.
- I did not run the contributor-analyzer agent. The `git log` data was enough for 7 files.

